      <TableRow>
      <TableCell><code>failureDomains</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell><code>array</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell>failureDomains configures failure domains information for the Nutanix platform. When set, the failure domains defined here may be used to spread Machines across prism element clusters to improve fault tolerance of the cluster.</TableCell>
      </TableRow>
      <TableRow>
      <TableCell><code>failureDomains[]</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell><code>object</code></TableCell>
