      <Table class="my-4">
      <TableHeader>
      <TableRow>
      <TableHead>Property</TableHead>
      <TableHead>Type</TableHead>
      <TableHead>Description</TableHead>
      </TableRow>
      </TableHeader>
      <TableBody>
      <TableRow>
      <TableCell><code>hostGroup</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell><code>string</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell>hostGroup is the name of the vm-host group of type host within vCenter for this failure domain. hostGroup is limited to 80 characters. This field is required when the VSphereFailureDomain ZoneType is HostGroup</TableCell>
      </TableRow>
      <TableRow>
