      <TableCell>key is the key part of the tag. A tag key can have a maximum of 63 characters and cannot be empty. Tag key must begin and end with an alphanumeric character, and must contain only uppercase, lowercase alphanumeric characters, and the following special characters <code>._-</code>.</TableCell>
      </TableRow>
      <TableRow>
      <TableCell><code>parentID</code></TableCell>
